==Battleground==
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*4 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 43.33 seconds<sup>1,300f</sup>, delay 13.33~16.67 seconds<sup>400f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>, delay 16.67~33.33 seconds<sup>500f~1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Doge Dark]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**4 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn, delay 10~12 seconds<sup>300f~360f</sup>.
**2 [[Dagshund]]s spawn, delay 8~9.33 seconds<sup>240f~280f</sup>.
**15 [[Doge Dark]]s (100%) spawn, delay 3.33~5.33 seconds<sup>100f~160f</sup>.

==Strategy==
This stage is an exact copy of [[Reforming Comment]], so any strategies used there will also work here.

As with all the other stages prior, meatshields and [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] are sufficient.

